#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:101
msgid ""
"Designed from the ground-up for KDE4, using KDE4 technology:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Hardware handling with KDE4's Solid interface;</li>"
"<li>More comprehensive multimedia file handling using KDE4's Phonon interface;</li>"
"<li>Easy Geolocation with KDE4's Marble interface.</li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"Heel un Deel för KDE-4 utwickelt, mit KDE-4-Technik:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Hanteren mit Hardware över KDE-4 sien Koppelsteed »Solid«</li>"
"<li>Beter Hanteren mit Multimedia-Dateien över KDE-4 sien »Phonon«-Koppelsteed</li>"
"<li>Eenfach Stedenpleeg över de KDE-4-Koppelsteed »Marble«</li>"
"</ul>"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:105
msgid "XMP metadata support;"
msgstr "Ünnerstütten vun XMP-Metadaten"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:106
msgid "TIFF/EP RAW metadata editing;"
msgstr "TIFF/EP-Roh-Metadaten bewerken"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:107
msgid "Customizable file storage for the digiKam database, supporting remote albums;"
msgstr "Steed vun de digiKam-Datenbank lett sik topassen, mit Ünnerstütten för feern Alben"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:108
msgid "Support of multiple root album paths (no more importing into one giant album);"
msgstr "Ünnerstütt mehr as een Wörtelalbum (Importeren na een resig Album deit nich mehr noot)"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:109
msgid "Thumbnail-bar integration for easy navigation and editing;"
msgstr "Inbunnen Vöransichtbalken - eenfacher Stüern un Bewerken"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:110
msgid "Supports the latest camera RAW files;"
msgstr "Ünnerstütt de niegsten Kamera-Rohdateien"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:111
msgid ""
"New/revamped tools:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Batch queue manager;</li>"
"<li>Revamped camera import wizard;</li>"
"<li>LensFun integration: auto-correction of lens distortion;</li>"
"<li>Fuzzy searches based on hand-drawn sketches;</li>"
"<li>Advanced searches using image meta-information, such as keywords and dates;</li>"
"<li>User-friendly map searching that gives you the power to search for global photo locations;</li>"
"<li>Advanced searches for duplicate and similar images;</li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"Nieg/opfrischt Warktüüch:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Bültopgavenreegpleger</li>"
"<li>Opfrischt Importeerhölper för Kameras</li>"
"<li>Lins-Warktüüch inbunnen: autom. Richten vun Linsvertarren</li>"
"<li>Liekheit-Söken na handmaalt Skizzen</li>"
"<li>Verwiedert Söök na Metadaten, a.B. na Slötelwöör un Datum</li>"
"<li>Söken op de Koort na smuck Foto-Öörd op de Wereld.</li>"
"<li>Verwiedert Söök na liek un dubbelt Biller</li>"
"</ul>"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:119
msgid "...and much more."
msgstr "... un veel anner Saken mehr."

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:124
msgid ""
"<li>%1</li>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<li>%1</li>"
"\n"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/welcomepageview.cpp:137
msgctxt "%1: current digiKam version; %2: digiKam help:// Url; %3: digiKam homepage Url; %4: prior digiKam version; %5: prior KDE version; %6: generated list of new features; %7: generated list of important changes; --- end of comment ---"
msgid ""
"<h2 style='margin-top: 0px;'>Welcome to digiKam %1</h2>"
"<p>digiKam is an open source photo management program designed to import, organize, enhance, search and export your digital images to and from your computer.</p>"
"<p>Currently, you are in the Album view mode of digiKam. Albums are the places where your files are stored, and are identical to the folders on your hard disk.</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul>"
"<li>digiKam has many powerful features which are described in the <a href=\"%2\">documentation</a></li>"
"<li>The <a href=\"%3\">digiKam homepage</A> provides information about new versions of digiKam.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</p>"
"<p>%7</p>"
"<p>Some of the new features in this release of digiKam include (compared to digiKam %4):</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul>%5</ul>"
"</p>"
"<p>%6</p>"
"<p>We hope that you will enjoy digiKam.</p>"
"<p>Thank you,</p>"
"<p style='margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left:20px;'>The digiKam team</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h2 style='margin-top: 0px;'>Willkamen bi digiKam %1</h2>"
"<p>DigiKam is en Apenborn-Fotopleegprogramm. Dor kannst Du Dien Fotos mit op Dien Reekner halen un verbetern, Dien Sammeln plegen un de Biller ok wedder exporteren.</p>"
"<p>Opstunns büst Du in de Albenansicht vun digiKam. Alben sünd de Steden woneem Dien Dateien wohrt warrt, op de Fastplaat sünd dat Ornern.</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul>"
"<li>digiKam hett vele deegte Funkschonen, se sünd binnen de <a href=\"%2\">Dokmentatschoon</a> beschreven.</li>"
"<li>Op de <a href=\"%3\">digiKam-Tohuussiet</a> gifft dat Informatschonen över niege Verschonen.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</p>"
"<p>%7</p>"
"<p>Hier en poor vun de niegen Funkschonen vun disse Utgaav (günt digiKam %4):</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul>%5</ul>"
"</p>"
"<p>%6</p>"
"<p>Wi haapt, Du hest mit digiKam veel Spaaß.</p>"
"<p>Dank ok,</p>"
"<p style='margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left:20px;'>De digiKam-Koppel</p>"

