"<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default.<br/>"
"<b>Remove Small Artifact</b>: in-paint small image artifacts, such as image glitches.<br/>"
"<b>Remove Medium Artifact</b>: in-paint medium image artifacts.<br/>"
"<b>Remove Large Artifact</b>: in-paint large image artifacts, such as unwanted objects.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den vörinstellt Filter utsöken, den Du för't Foto bruken wullt:</p>"
"<p><b><b>Keen</b>: Tomehrst bruukte Weerten, sett allens op de Vörinstellen.<br/>"
"<b>Lütt Objekt wegmaken</b>: övermaalt lütte Objekten, so as Bildfehlers.<br/>"
"<b>Middelgroot Objekt wegmaken</b>: övermaalt middelgroot Objekten.<br/>"
"<b>Groot Objekt wegmaken</b>: övermaalt grote (a.B. leegleden) Objekten.</p>"

