#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:137
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "Enkelheiten wohren:"

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:141
msgid "Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features in the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr "\"Enkelheiten wohren\" leggt de Scharpteek-Stoop för lütte Objekten binnen dat Teelbild fast. Grötter Weerten maakt disse Enkelheiten scharp."

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:145
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Richtenafhangigkeit:"

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:149
msgid "Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for Gaussian noise."
msgstr "Richtenafhangen Modifikator för Enkelheiten. Laat em lütt, vun wegen dat Gauß'sche Rusen."

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:152
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Weekheit:"

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:156
msgid "Total smoothing power: if the Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and the Anisotropy Factor the direction, the Smoothing Factor sets the overall effect."
msgstr "Heel Weekmaak-Stärk: De Enkelheiten-Fakter leggt dat relative Weekmaken fast, de Richtafhangigkeit de Richt, un de Weekmaak-Faktor den Heeleffekt."

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:160
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Evenheit:"

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:164
msgid "This value controls the evenness of smoothing to the image. Do not use a high value here, or the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr "Disse Weert stüert de Weekmaak-Evenheit vun dat Bild. Bruuk hier keen hogen Weert, anners warrt dat Teelbild heel verwischt."

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:168
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Wedderhalen:"

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:172
msgid "Sets the number of times the filter is applied to the image."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wo faken de Filter för dat Bild bruukt warrt."

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:174
msgid "Noise:"
msgstr "Rusen:"

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:178
msgid "Sets the noise scale."
msgstr "Leggt den Ruusweert fast."

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:202
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Winkelschritt:"

#. +> trunk
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:206
